---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">{{ site.tagline }}</div>
      <h1>Nothing<br>Gets to You</h1>
      <p class="sub">{{ site.subtitle }}</p>
      <div class="buy">
        <div class="btn-row">
          {% if site.amazon.kindle %}<a class="btn" href="{{ site.amazon.kindle }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy on Kindle</a>{% endif %}
          {% if site.amazon.paperback %}<a class="btn ghost" href="{{ site.amazon.paperback }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buy the paperback</a>{% else %}<a class="btn ghost" href="/book/">What it's about</a>{% endif %}
        </div>
        {% if not site.amazon.paperback %}<p class="soon">Paperback coming soon.</p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cover-shot">
      <img src="/assets/cover.jpg" alt="Nothing Gets to You book cover" width="320" height="512">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="panel">
  <h2>Most of us were never taught a third option</h2>
  <p class="lead">When something stings, a cold email, a remark across the table, a message at nine at night, we either swallow it and stew, or fire back and spend hours living with the fallout. The reaction takes a second. The cost stays long after everyone else has moved on.</p>
  <p><strong>Nothing Gets to You</strong> is about the space in between: the small pause where you get to choose your response instead of having it chosen for you. Not by feeling less. By being moved less. Not a quieter world, but a steadier you.</p>
  <div class="rule"><span></span></div>
  <div class="grid2">
    <div>
      <h3 style="font-family:Anton,sans-serif;text-transform:none;color:var(--red-dark)">What's inside</h3>
      <ul class="checks">
        <li>Why being right so rarely brings peace</li>
        <li>How your oldest triggers work, and how to disarm them</li>
        <li>The power of the pause, and how to build it</li>
        <li>How to respond instead of react in the hot moment</li>
        <li>What to do after you slip, and stay steady for good</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <p class="pullquote">"Calm is not the same as staying silent. It is how you think clearly enough to act well."</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap">
  <h2 style="color:var(--ink);text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px">From the blog</h2>
  <div class="rule"><span></span></div>
  <div class="post-list">
    <a class="post-item" href="{{ featured.url }}">
      <div class="date">Reflection of the week</div>
      <h3>{{ featured.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ featured.description }}</p>
    </a>
    {% for post in collections.posts | recentExcluding(featured.url, 3) %}
    <a class="post-item" href="{{ post.url }}">
      <div class="date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</div>
      <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.pageDescription }}</p>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:20px"><a class="btn ghost" href="/blog/">Read the blog</a></p>
</div></section>
